<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
    <head>
        <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
        <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
        <meta name="google" content="notranslate" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <!-- 모바일 대응 -->
        <title>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다</title>
        <style>
            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            body, html {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                font-family: Pretendard, sans-serif;
            }

            .container {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                height: 100vh;
                padding: 16px;
            }

            .containerDiv {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 8px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .popomonHeading_1 {
                font-size: 24px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #2A2A2A;
                margin: 0;
            }

            .popomonTitle_1 {
                font-size: 18px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #616161;
                line-height: 1.4;
                margin: 16px 0;
            }

            .containerBtn {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 12px;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 360px;
            }

            .btn {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                padding: 12px;
                width: 100%;
                border-radius: 4px;
                font-size: 16px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .bg_purple {
                background-color: #714DFE;
                color: white;
                border: none;
            }

            .bg_white {
                background-color: white;
                color: #714DFE;
                border: 1px solid #714DFE;
            }

            @media (max-width: 600px) {
                .popomonHeading_1 {
                    font-size: 20px;
                }

                .popomonTitle_1 {
                    font-size: 16px;
                }

                .btn {
                    font-size: 14px;
                    padding: 10px;
                }
            }
        </style>
        <script>
            const handelChatClick = () => {
                location.href = "/";
            }
        </script>
    </head>
    <body style="overflow: hidden;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="containerDiv">
                <img src="/assets/images/icon/ico_caution_white.svg" alt="점검 이미지" title="점검 이미지"><br/>
                <b class="popomonHeading_1">페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</b>
                <p class="popomonTitle_1">네트워크가 일시적으로 끊겼거나 페이지를 불러오지<br>못하였으니 잠시 후 다시 시도해주세요.</p><br/>
                <div class="containerBtn">
                    <button class="btn bg_purple" onclick="handelChatClick()">홈으로</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
